{"id": "rijks-20026359", "status": "ok", "meta": "An earthenware jar, three fish on a colander and fruit on a wooden box, a still life by Harmen Steenwijck, 1652.", "about": "Harmen Steenwijck's still life of 1652 shows an earthenware jar, three fish on a pottery colander and fruit on a wooden box, with a few peaches and berries. A butterfly and a caterpillar sit at the right. It is the pendant of another still life in the Rijksmuseum.", "museum_record": "https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/SK-A-1528--0b97a49a024e46d4912c9ed0d9e1481a", "inventory_number": "", "dimensions": "", "credit_line": "", "sources": ["https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/SK-A-1528--0b97a49a024e46d4912c9ed0d9e1481a", "https://id.rijksmuseum.nl/20026359"], "check": "clean"}
